{
  "$schema": "https://design-tokens.github.io/community-group/format/",
  "$description": "Platform design tokens. Single source of truth for visual values.",
  "$version": "1.0.0",

  "shared": {
    "font": {
      "sans": {
        "$value": "'Geist', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif",
        "$type": "fontFamily"
      },
      "mono": {
        "$value": "'Geist Mono', 'SF Mono', Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace",
        "$type": "fontFamily"
      }
    },
    "size": {
      "font-base": { "$value": "14px", "$type": "dimension" },
      "control-xs": { "$value": "16px", "$type": "dimension" },
      "control-sm": { "$value": "24px", "$type": "dimension" },
      "control": { "$value": "28px", "$type": "dimension" },
      "control-lg": { "$value": "36px", "$type": "dimension" },
      "step": { "$value": "4px", "$type": "dimension" },
      "unit": { "$value": "4px", "$type": "dimension" }
    },
    "spacing": {
      "$comment": "Spacing scale — 2px-based grid, numeric naming (spacing.8 = 8px direct mapping).\n\nDesign basis (data from SPACING-SURVEY.md, 243 tsx + 8 css findings):\n- 4px grid covers only 79% of observed usage; 2px grid covers 99.2%\n- Anomaly value 5px (1 occurrence) normalized to 4px\n- Anomaly value 3px (KbdShortcut letter gap) kept as off-grid spacing.3 token — visually critical for kbd letter density, 1px shift to 2px or 4px breaks the design\n- Negative values handled inline via calc(var(--spacing-N) * -1) — no separate negative scale\n\nNaming convention:\n- Numeric (not semantic xs/sm/md/lg) — spacing is a quantitative property, direct px mapping is unambiguous and zero cognitive overhead\n- Deliberately differs from font-size (which uses semantic micro/caption/body — content-role naming)\n- Easy to extend: add new value (e.g. spacing.18) without disrupting existing names\n\nUsage:\n- padding / margin / gap / inset all share this scale (no separate inset/gap tokens)\n- Logical properties (paddingInline / marginBlock / etc.) use the same scale (no separate logical tokens)\n- For shorthand: 'var(--spacing-32) var(--spacing-16)' is valid CSS\n- For dense variants: organize at component level (dense ? var(--spacing-8) : var(--spacing-12))",
      "0": {
        "$value": "0px",
        "$type": "dimension",
        "$description": "Reset (margin: 0 / inset: 0 / etc.)"
      },
      "2": {
        "$value": "2px",
        "$type": "dimension",
        "$description": "Micro — badge alignment, ultra-tight gap (15 occurrences)"
      },
      "3": {
        "$value": "3px",
        "$type": "dimension",
        "$description": "Off-grid — KbdShortcut letter gap (1 occurrence, kept off main 2px grid for kbd density)"
      },
      "4": {
        "$value": "4px",
        "$type": "dimension",
        "$description": "XS — icon gap, micro padding (24 occurrences)"
      },
      "6": {
        "$value": "6px",
        "$type": "dimension",
        "$description": "Tight gap — gap 主力之一 (29 occurrences, 17 in gap)"
      },
      "8": {
        "$value": "8px",
        "$type": "dimension",
        "$description": "SM — gap default (47 occurrences, 38 in gap)"
      },
      "10": {
        "$value": "10px",
        "$type": "dimension",
        "$description": "Off-grid micro — dense compact spots (6 occurrences)"
      },
      "12": {
        "$value": "12px",
        "$type": "dimension",
        "$description": "MD compact (39 occurrences)"
      },
      "14": {
        "$value": "14px",
        "$type": "dimension",
        "$description": "Off-grid medium — legacy spots (5 occurrences)"
      },
      "16": {
        "$value": "16px",
        "$type": "dimension",
        "$description": "MD — padding/margin 主力 (50 occurrences)"
      },
      "20": {
        "$value": "20px",
        "$type": "dimension",
        "$description": "Medium-large (9 occurrences)"
      },
      "24": { "$value": "24px", "$type": "dimension", "$description": "LG (11 occurrences)" },
      "28": { "$value": "28px", "$type": "dimension", "$description": "Larger (4 occurrences)" },
      "32": {
        "$value": "32px",
        "$type": "dimension",
        "$description": "XL (3 occurrences — AuthShell card padding)"
      },
      "40": { "$value": "40px", "$type": "dimension", "$description": "XXL (1 occurrence — rare)" },
      "48": {
        "$value": "48px",
        "$type": "dimension",
        "$description": "Hero spacing (1 occurrence — rare)"
      },
      "64": {
        "$value": "64px",
        "$type": "dimension",
        "$description": "Empty-state vertical padding (1 occurrence)"
      },
      "80": {
        "$value": "80px",
        "$type": "dimension",
        "$description": "AppShell offset (2 occurrences)"
      }
    },
    "dimension": {
      "$comment": "Container/widget size scale for inline width / height / min-* / max-* / flex-basis literals.\n\nNOTE: 'dimension' here is our scale BLOCK NAME, distinct from W3C Design Tokens spec where 'dimension' is a TYPE label for any length value. All tokens in this block have $type 'dimension' per W3C spec. Separate from AntD ThemeConfig 'size' bindings (font-base / control-xs / control / control-lg). Numeric naming: dimension.180 = 180px direct mapping.\n\nDesign basis (data from SIZE-SURVEY.md, 55 tsx + 4 css findings):\n- 4px grid covers 88% of observed usage\n- Anomaly values 90 / 110 / 10 / 18 / 22 retained as real design choices (not normalized — would introduce 1-2px visual diff)\n- horizontal / vertical share single scale (overlap 4 values + horizontal-only 11 + vertical-only 5 — no strong dimensional split signal)",
      "0": {
        "$value": "0px",
        "$type": "dimension",
        "$description": "Reset (minWidth/maxWidth: 0 — flex shrink permission, 14 occurrences)"
      },
      "10": {
        "$value": "10px",
        "$type": "dimension",
        "$description": "Micro element (global.css cursor dot etc, CSS-only)"
      },
      "18": {
        "$value": "18px",
        "$type": "dimension",
        "$description": "Widget compact — HairlineTag sm height"
      },
      "22": {
        "$value": "22px",
        "$type": "dimension",
        "$description": "Widget default — HairlineTag default height"
      },
      "28": { "$value": "28px", "$type": "dimension", "$description": "Control / compact row" },
      "36": { "$value": "36px", "$type": "dimension", "$description": "Standard row height" },
      "44": {
        "$value": "44px",
        "$type": "dimension",
        "$description": "Icon container (EmptyState icon)"
      },
      "56": {
        "$value": "56px",
        "$type": "dimension",
        "$description": "Header / topbar height (AuthShell topbar)"
      },
      "90": {
        "$value": "90px",
        "$type": "dimension",
        "$description": "Alarm table column width (DeviceDetail/AlarmTab)"
      },
      "110": {
        "$value": "110px",
        "$type": "dimension",
        "$description": "Form button width (Login/Forgot password)"
      },
      "120": {
        "$value": "120px",
        "$type": "dimension",
        "$description": "Nav max width (AppShell nickname truncate)"
      },
      "180": {
        "$value": "180px",
        "$type": "dimension",
        "$description": "Hint width / data height (DataGrid loading state)"
      },
      "200": {
        "$value": "200px",
        "$type": "dimension",
        "$description": "Menu min width (AppShell signed-in-as dropdown)"
      },
      "220": { "$value": "220px", "$type": "dimension", "$description": "Search input max width" },
      "240": {
        "$value": "240px",
        "$type": "dimension",
        "$description": "Sider / gallery item min width"
      },
      "260": {
        "$value": "260px",
        "$type": "dimension",
        "$description": "Section min / gallery item"
      },
      "280": {
        "$value": "280px",
        "$type": "dimension",
        "$description": "Overview card min / search column"
      },
      "320": {
        "$value": "320px",
        "$type": "dimension",
        "$description": "Hero card / aurora dimension"
      },
      "360": {
        "$value": "360px",
        "$type": "dimension",
        "$description": "EmptyState description max width"
      },
      "420": {
        "$value": "420px",
        "$type": "dimension",
        "$description": "Page form / reset password card max width"
      },
      "520": { "$value": "520px", "$type": "dimension", "$description": "Aurora ring (CSS-only)" },
      "720": {
        "$value": "720px",
        "$type": "dimension",
        "$description": "PageHeader description max width"
      }
    },
    "font-size": {
      "$comment": "Font-size scale. Main progression: micro → caption → body → ui → subtitle → title (linear size, paired with -lg half-steps). Specialized off main scale: callout (15px, emphatic inline like brand wordmark) sits between ui and subtitle as a semantic anchor — not on the linear half-step grid. display / display-lg (22 / 24px) for large headings beyond title — display for card-level h1 (AuthShell), display-lg for page-level h1 (PageHeader). Naming separates dimension: main = size axis; callout = emphasis axis; display(-lg) = large-heading axis.",
      "micro": {
        "$value": "11px",
        "$type": "dimension",
        "$description": "Tiny uppercase labels / row kickers"
      },
      "micro-lg": {
        "$value": "11.5px",
        "$type": "dimension",
        "$description": "Half-step above micro (nav active label compaction)"
      },
      "caption": { "$value": "12px", "$type": "dimension", "$description": "Metadata / hint text" },
      "caption-lg": {
        "$value": "12.5px",
        "$type": "dimension",
        "$description": "Half-step above caption (tab labels, secondary chips)"
      },
      "body": {
        "$value": "13px",
        "$type": "dimension",
        "$description": "Default body text inside cards / lists / tables"
      },
      "body-lg": {
        "$value": "13.5px",
        "$type": "dimension",
        "$description": "Emphasized body (description paragraphs on overview/runtime)"
      },
      "ui": {
        "$value": "14px",
        "$type": "dimension",
        "$description": "Inline header text / brand-mark accompaniment"
      },
      "callout": {
        "$value": "15px",
        "$type": "dimension",
        "$description": "Emphatic inline (brand wordmark / standalone label) — between ui and subtitle, off main scale"
      },
      "subtitle": {
        "$value": "16px",
        "$type": "dimension",
        "$description": "Section subtitle inside gallery / forms"
      },
      "title": {
        "$value": "18px",
        "$type": "dimension",
        "$description": "Avatar+name composite heading"
      },
      "display": {
        "$value": "22px",
        "$type": "dimension",
        "$description": "Card-level h1 (AuthShell card title)"
      },
      "display-lg": {
        "$value": "24px",
        "$type": "dimension",
        "$description": "Page-level h1 (PageHeader title)"
      }
    },
    "font-weight": {
      "regular": { "$value": "400", "$type": "number", "$description": "Body default" },
      "medium": {
        "$value": "500",
        "$type": "number",
        "$description": "Emphasized inline / nav active / button label"
      },
      "semibold": { "$value": "600", "$type": "number", "$description": "Heading / strong inline" }
    },
    "font-feature-settings": {
      "mono": {
        "$value": "\"ss01\" 1, \"cv11\" 1",
        "$type": "string",
        "$description": "Geist Mono 等宽数字 (ss01) + 替代字形 (cv11). NOTE: $type=string 非 W3C 标准 — W3C typography 复合类型草案未来可考虑"
      }
    },
    "letter-spacing": {
      "$comment": "Letter-spacing scale derived from observed usage.\n\nNaming convention:\n- Positive tracking (uppercase contexts): kicker / nav / subtle (by purpose)\n- Negative tracking (heading densification): tight / tighter / tightest (by intensity)\n- mono: Geist Mono-specific\n- display: display-sized text tracking — aligned with font-size.display naming for typographic coherence but NOT strictly bound (use with any font-size; it's about visual tightness for large text optical compensation).",
      "mono": {
        "$value": "-0.005em",
        "$type": "dimension",
        "$description": "Geist Mono 字距微调,让 ID/IP 数字串显示更紧凑"
      },
      "kicker": {
        "$value": "0.04em",
        "$type": "dimension",
        "$description": "Vercel uppercase kicker / section label tracking(SectionCard kicker / HairlineSection kicker)"
      },
      "nav": {
        "$value": "0.02em",
        "$type": "dimension",
        "$description": "Nav micro uppercase 间距(AppShell nav active label)"
      },
      "subtle": {
        "$value": "0.01em",
        "$type": "dimension",
        "$description": "弱 uppercase 间距(_gallery 等次要标签)"
      },
      "text-tight": {
        "$value": "-0.012em",
        "$type": "dimension",
        "$description": "Body 文本微紧(EmptyState description / HairlineSection title)"
      },
      "heading-tight": {
        "$value": "-0.015em",
        "$type": "dimension",
        "$description": "h3 标题字距(SectionCard title / Account ProfilePage)"
      },
      "heading-tighter": {
        "$value": "-0.02em",
        "$type": "dimension",
        "$description": "h2 标题字距(AppShell h2 / AuthShell title)"
      },
      "heading-tightest": {
        "$value": "-0.03em",
        "$type": "dimension",
        "$description": "Brand / h1 字距(AuthShell brand)"
      },
      "display": {
        "$value": "-0.035em",
        "$type": "dimension",
        "$description": "Display-sized heading tracking(PageHeader h1 24px / future hero text)— optical compensation for large text, independent of font-size token"
      }
    },
    "line-height": {
      "tight": {
        "$value": "1",
        "$type": "number",
        "$description": "Single-line UI (badge / dot+label / StatusDot)"
      },
      "snug": {
        "$value": "1.2",
        "$type": "number",
        "$description": "Heading composite (PageHeader title)"
      },
      "normal": {
        "$value": "1.4",
        "$type": "number",
        "$description": "Default body / metadata line / row label"
      },
      "relaxed": {
        "$value": "1.5",
        "$type": "number",
        "$description": "Inset description (EmptyState body)"
      },
      "loose": {
        "$value": "1.55",
        "$type": "number",
        "$description": "Dense paragraph (overview/runtime descriptions, gallery body)"
      }
    },
    "radius": {
      "$comment": "Radius scale spans two semantic dimensions.\n\nMain size-based progression: xs (2px) → tag (4px) → control (6px) → card (8px) — for rectangular elements where radius scales with element prominence (chips < controls < cards).\n\nShape-based: pill (9999px) — for capsule/pill buttons where radius >> height creates fully rounded ends regardless of button height. Use pill for buttons that should be pill-shaped at any height; use main scale for rectangular elements.",
      "xs": {
        "$value": "2px",
        "$type": "dimension",
        "$description": "Small chips / tight indicators"
      },
      "tag": { "$value": "4px", "$type": "dimension", "$description": "Tag / badge corners" },
      "control": {
        "$value": "6px",
        "$type": "dimension",
        "$description": "Buttons / inputs / segmented controls"
      },
      "card": {
        "$value": "8px",
        "$type": "dimension",
        "$description": "Cards / panels / containers"
      },
      "pill": {
        "$value": "9999px",
        "$type": "dimension",
        "$description": "Pill/capsule button. Use when border-radius >> height for fully rounded ends regardless of button height."
      }
    },
    "line": {
      "default": { "$value": "1px", "$type": "dimension" },
      "bold": { "$value": "2px", "$type": "dimension" },
      "focus": { "$value": "3px", "$type": "dimension" }
    },
    "motion": {
      "fast": { "$value": "0.1s", "$type": "duration" },
      "mid": { "$value": "0.15s", "$type": "duration" },
      "slow": { "$value": "0.2s", "$type": "duration" }
    },
    "z-index": {
      "popup-base": { "$value": "1000", "$type": "number" }
    }
  },

